From dab2accef4273dd6155871bfe9c68cf7eef405d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kaixin Liu <liukaixin1@h-partners.com>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 16:20:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] feat(cpu): wire optimized matmul & fused SDPA kernels
 into ggml dispatch

- type_traits_cpu: enable is_matmul_valid and hook matmul for F16 / Q8_0
  (FP32 keeps the vec_dot path, matmul left commented out)
- ggml_compute_forward_mul_mat: route F16/F32/Q8_0 matmuls to the new
  packed micro-kernels (compute_forward_mul_mat_one_chunk_matmul_kernel),
  add FP16 M-only scheduling and Q8_0 M-only scheduling heuristics
- add GGML_OP_FUSED_CPP_SDPA_EXT compute + n_tasks dispatch cases
- NEON fp16<->fp32 conversion fast paths in ggml_cpu_fp32_to_fp16 /
  ggml_cpu_fp16_to_fp32
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cpu/ggml-cpu.c | 566 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 532 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

